rial;
  color:#161616'>This challenge lesson checks whether you can recognize an
  algorithm when you see one. An algorithm is not just a topic label, a ran=
dom
  list, or a vague goal. It is a clear, ordered set of steps that can be
  followed to solve a problem or complete a task.</span></p>
