  <p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:0in'><span style=3D'font-size=
:10.5pt;
  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'>This lesson shows why &quot;it works&quot;=
 is
  not the finish line. Two solutions can produce the same answer, but one m=
ay
  be faster, cleaner, easier to explain, or safer to maintain. Algorithm
  analysis gives you a way to compare those choices instead of choosing bas=
ed
  on vibes alone - although, tragically, vibes remain undefeated in group
  projects.</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
