  mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;line-height:106%;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#212121'>Week 3 is the bridge from 'I=
 can
  write code' to 'I can reason about code.' The key skill is learning to
  describe an algorithm clearly, count the amount of work it does, and comp=
are
  two possible solutions without getting hypnotized by small details.</span=
></p>
  <p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-top:0in;margin-right:2.5pt;margin-bo=
ttom:
