amily:
  Arial;color:#212121'>A correct answer is not automatically the best answe=
r.
  Two algorithms can return the same result while having different speed,
  clarity, memory use, and safety. Week 3 asks you to keep thinking like a
  programmer who <span class=3DGramE>has to</span> choose between options, =
not
  just make any code work once.</span></p>
